WEBVTT

00:09:58.560 --> 00:10:03.496
He's still in prison.
He just turned 37 on September 22,

00:10:03.520 --> 00:10:05.416
but I have some good news.

00:10:05.440 --> 00:10:08.216
We've been trying
to get him out for 12 years.

00:10:08.240 --> 00:10:11.456
He finally will join us a year from now.

00:10:11.480 --> 00:10:15.120
(Applause)

00:10:18.240 --> 00:10:20.976
And I'm very excited to have him join us,

00:10:21.000 --> 00:10:23.096
because I know we've saved him,

00:10:23.120 --> 00:10:26.576
but he will save
tens of thousands of students

00:10:26.600 --> 00:10:29.096
when he shares his testimony

00:10:29.120 --> 00:10:32.496
in schools that we are present at
on a regular basis.